{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c767","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c45a-c3aa-73a1-9c84-6d5fc23e6787"},"sequence":526,"recorded_at":1780531400001047,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c45c-2c9a-71c2-8e06-81723b47c308"},"task_id":"01a0c45c-2c9a-71c2-8e06-81723b47c308","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c45c-2c9a-71c2-8e06-81723b47c308","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-35urbp/TASK-260830-35urbp_conformance-matrix.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-35urbp conformance matrix — implement-private-tmux-server-management (rev3)\n2|\n3|Authority: pinned `internal/specdoc/SPEC.v0.7.0.md`. Every row names the\n4|spec clause in the spec's own words, the production call site, and the\n5|named committed test that drives it through that entry. 55 of 55 rows\n6|driven (row 55 extends the rows 19-22 override class with the fifth\n7|ambient member). Bounds B1-B18 are stated in\n8|`internal/tmuxserver/TRACEABILITY.md`. Changes from rev2: row 4 pins\n9|the narrower side, row 5 names both custody entries plus the\n10|background `Acquire`, row 23 covers unclean spellings, rows 36/38\n11|cover the both-empty pair, and the mutant map carries six new\n12|narrowing rows.\n13|\n14|Attestation authority: sentinel/smoke sufficiency, signature\n15|verification, liveness, and expiry are the landed\n16|`internal/terminalbackend` Reconcile/ResolveEvidence admission verdict,\n17|consumed here as an `Admitted` set composed only with the generation\n18|equality `internal/axpane` checkRealm enforces. This leaf decides\n19|membership plus generation binding and re-decides nothing.\n20|\n21|## §4.2 dedicated -S server; no ambient/default discovery or reuse\n22|\n23|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n24||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n25|| 16 | AX MUST use its dedicated `-S` server | `SocketPath` (socket.go) | TestSocketPathDerivesOnlyFromRuntimeDir |\n26|| 17 | MUST NOT discover or reuse the default server by ambient socket name, under hostile ambient on all five members | `ResolveSocket` (socket.go) | TestResolveSocketDerivesIgnoringAmbient |\n27|| 18 | Ambient facts observed without use | `ObserveAmbient` (socket.go) | TestObserveAmbientRecordsWithoutUsing, TestObserveAmbientNilLookupKeepsOutOfBand |\n28|| 19 | Environment-variable vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/environment_variable |\n29|| 20 | Inherited-socket vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/inherited_socket |\n30|| 21 | Default-path vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/default_path |\n31|| 22 | Conventional-name vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/conventional_name |\n32|| 55 | TMUX_TMPDIR vector refuses with no spawn and no directory | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesEveryAmbientOverrideVector/tmux_tmpdir |\n33|| 23 | Ambient value colliding with the derived socket refuses on every member, byte-identical and unclean (`/./`, `//`) spellings alike | `Acquire` via `ResolveSocket` | TestAcquireRefusesAmbientCollision (5 subtests), TestResolveSocketRefusesAmbientCollision (5 subtests), TestResolveSocketRefusesAmbientCollisionUncleanSpellings (2 subtests), TestAcquireRefusesAmbientCollisionUncleanSpelling |\n34|| 40 | Absent server spawns dedicated with exact -S argv disjoint from every ambient vector | `Acquire` via `BuildArgv` | TestAcquireForegroundSpawnsDedicatedServer |\n35|| 41 | Running attested dedicated server attaches with no second spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireForegroundAttachesToRunningAttested |\n36|| 46 | Spawn vector carries the dedicated -S socket | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvAddressesOnlyTheDerivedSocket |\n37|| 47 | Ambient sockets refuse at the spawn vector on all five members | `BuildArgv` (argv.go) | TestBuildArgvRefusesAmbientSocket (5 subtests) |\n38|\n39|## §4.2 credential-sensitive creation; background broker-or-refuse\n40|\n41|| # | Clause (spec words) | Call site | Test |\n42||---|---------------------|-----------|------|\n43|| 24 | A background CLI MAY contact an already-running authenticated Aqua broker and its attested AX tmux server (macOS) | `Acquire` via `CheckBrokerContact` | TestAcquireBackgroundContactsBroker |\n44|| 25 | If neither exists it MUST return `capability_unavailable` with typed realm/readiness details: no broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/no_broker |\n45|| 26 | Same: foreign-user broker | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/foreign-user_broker |\n46|| 27 | Same: unattested server | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/unattested_server |\n47|| 28 | Same: stale-generation admission | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissReturnsTypedUnavailable/stale_server_admission, .../generation-unbound_principal |\n48|| 29 | Linux background miss likewise refuses without fallback | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundMissOnLinuxAlsoRefusesWithoutFallback |\n49|| 30 | Broker probe failure is unknown, never unavailable, with no spawn | `Acquire` | TestAcquireBackgroundProbeFailurePassesThrough |\n50|| 31 | A Background caller MUST NOT create a credential-dependent tmux server; MUST NOT fall back to direct server creation | `checkCreationAllowed` via `Acquire` | TestCheckCreationAllowedRefusesBackground, TestAcquireBackground