{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c86d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0c45a-c3aa-73a1-9c84-6d5fc23e6787"},"sequence":657,"recorded_at":1780531400001309,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"892d0e23-8edf-4e7b-8430-1bc89cf9b07d"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0c45c-615b-7091-a222-78f5c437fbed"},"task_id":"01a0c45c-615b-7091-a222-78f5c437fbed","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0c45c-615b-7091-a222-78f5c437fbed","chunk":"Read text file `internal/tmuxserver/ownership_unix.go`.\n1|//go:build !windows\n2|\n3|package tmuxserver\n4|\n5|import (\n6|\t\"io/fs\"\n7|\t\"os\"\n8|\t\"syscall\"\n9|)\n10|\n11|// effectiveUID reports the process effective UID. It is a variable\n12|// only so seam-failure tests can force the foreign-ownership path\n13|// through the production entries: staging a foreign-owned directory\n14|// needs privilege no test may assume, and without the seam the\n15|// ownership refusal is untestable. Production code never reassigns\n16|// it.\n17|var effectiveUID = os.Geteuid\n18|\n19|// currentUID reports the process effective UID the broker same-user\n20|// arm decides over. It reads the effectiveUID seam so tests stage a\n21|// foreign broker without privilege; production code never reassigns\n22|// the seam.\n23|func currentUID() uint32 { return uint32(effectiveUID()) }\n24|\n25|// verifyOwnership enforces the ownership gate on unix: the directory\n26|// must belong to the effective UID. Mode bits are checked by the\n27|// caller against the exact 0700 requirement, so any group or world\n28|// access already refused there. A stat without ownership metadata\n29|// fails closed: unreadable ownership is never legitimate custody.\n30|func verifyOwnership(info fs.FileInfo) error {\n31|\tstat, ok := info.Sys().(*syscall.Stat_t)\n32|\tif !ok {\n33|\t\treturn &Error{Code: CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir, Detail: \"runtime ownership\"}\n34|\t}\n35|\tif stat.Uid != uint32(effectiveUID()) {\n36|\t\treturn &Error{Code: CodeUnsafeRuntimeDir, Detail: \"runtime ownership\"}\n37|\t}\n38|\treturn nil\n39|}","final_result":true}}}
